lligence, Natural Language Processing, and Interprocess communication. Having a robust assistant improves the time efficiency as well as reduces the efforts to perform simple repetitive tasks.","topics":[],"score":246808,"global_rank":68584},{"name":"ZyTnT/Django-sample-userAuth","owner":"ZyTnT","html_url":"https://github.com/ZyTnT/Django-sample-userAuth","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":246808,"global_rank":68586},{"name":"MrinmayeeKulkarni/serverlessde","owner":"MrinmayeeKulkarni","html_url":"https://github.com/MrinmayeeKulkarni/serverlessde","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Serverless Data Engineering","topics":[],"score":246807,"global_rank":68590},{"name":"crdietrich/orion_pH","owner":"crdietrich","html_url":"https://github.com/crdietrich/orion_pH","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Serial Driver for Orion 290A+ pH Meter","topics":[],"score":246807,"global_rank":68592},{"name":"councit/pythonpong","owner":"councit","html_url":"https://github.com/councit/pythonpong","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Creating simple pong game with pygame","topics":[],"score":246807,"global_rank":68594},{"name":"jmnorma/Sukoku_ILP_Solver","owner":"jmnorma","html_url":"https://github.com/jmnorma/Sukoku_ILP_Solver","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Linear Programming Solution to Sudoku with GUI implementation ","topics":["integer-linear-programming","kivy","linear-programming","sudoku","sudoku-solver"],"score":246807,"global_rank":68596},{"name":"njhenry/google_scholar_scraper","owner":"njhenry","html_url":"https://github.com/njhenry/google_scholar_scraper","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A Python web scraper that returns the title, descriptive text, and links for every result of a Google Sc